mes/frame_2784.jpg'], 'response': "Based on the provided frames and the question criteria, the answer **'1'** is **correct** for the question: *What is the stoppage time for the first half?*\n\n### Evidence and Reasoning:\n\n- **Visible clock or timer showing 45+ minutes**: \n  - In **Frame 1**, the scoreboard in the top-left corner shows **45:41**, indicating the match is in stoppage time of the first half.\n  - The clock progresses through **Frame 20**, where it reads **46:00**, and continues to **Frame 30**, where it reads **46:10**.\n  - This confirms that the first half extended beyond 45 minutes into stoppage time.\n\n- **Stoppage time number displayed on an electronic board**:\n  - While no fourth official holding up a board is visible, the **scoreboard clearly shows the match time advancing from 45:41 to 46:10**.\n  - The first half ends at **46:10**, meaning **1 minute and 10 seconds** of stoppage time were played.\n  - In football, stoppage time is typically announced as a whole number (e.g., 1', 2', 3') by the fourth official, and the actual time played may slightly exceed that due to the clock continuing until the next stoppage.\n  - The fact that the clock reaches **46:00** (i.e., 1 minute past 45:00) and continues to 46:10 strongly implies that **1 minute of stoppage time was officially added**.\n\n- **Match officials indicating additional time for first half**:\n  - Although no official is seen holding up a board in these frames, the **progression of the match clock beyond 45:00 to 46:10** is direct evidence that stoppage time was added and played.\n  - In standard football practice, when the clock reaches 45:00 and continues, it means the referee has added stoppage time — and the amount added is typically the whole minute shown on the fourth official’s board.\n\n- **Temporal sequence**:\n  - The clock starts at **45:41** (Frame 1) and ends at **46:10** (Frame 30), meaning **29 seconds of gameplay occurred after 45:41**, reaching 46:10.\n  - The **first full minute of stoppage time (45:00–46:00)** is clearly passed, and the game continues slightly beyond, which is normal.\n  - Therefore, the **officially added stoppage time was 1 minute**.\n\n### Conclusion:\n\nAll criteria are satisfied through the **visible scoreboard clock**, which shows the match entering and progressing through **46:00**, confirming **1 minute of stoppage time** was added for the first half.\n\n✅ **Answer '1' is correct.**"}, {'batch_start': 30, 'batch_end': 60, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2785.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2786.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2787.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2788.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2789.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2790.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2791.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2792.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2793.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2794.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2795.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2796.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2797.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2798.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2799.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2800.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2801.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2802.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2803.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1