nd 45:01–45:02, with 1 minute of stoppage time officially added.\n\n---\n\n### Conclusion:\n\nThe scoreboard explicitly shows the game continuing past 45:00, with the first second of stoppage time appearing at **45:01**. This directly supports the answer **‘1’** as the stoppage time for the first half.\n\n✅ **Answer is correct.**"}, {'batch_start': 120, 'batch_end': 150, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2875.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2876.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2877.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2878.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2879.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2880.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2881.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2882.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2883.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2884.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2885.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2886.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2887.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2888.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2889.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2890.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2891.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2892.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2893.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2894.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2895.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data