alf**: No official is seen signaling or displaying the stoppage time.\n\n### Conclusion:\n\nSince **no visual evidence** exists in the frames to indicate that **1 minute of stoppage time was officially signaled or displayed**, the answer **\'1\' cannot be verified as correct**. The match is still in progress at 45:41, and the stoppage time has not yet been communicated or concluded.\n\n> ✅ Final Answer: **No, \'1\' is not correct based on the available visual evidence.**'}, {'batch_start': 150, 'batch_end': 180, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2905.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2906.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2907.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2908.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2909.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2910.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2911.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2912.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2913.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2914.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2915.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2916.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2917.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2918.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2919.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2920.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2921.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2922.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2923.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2924.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2925.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2926.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2927.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2928.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2929.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2930.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2931.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2932.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2933.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2934.jpg'], 'response': "Based on the provided frames and the question criteria, the answer **'1' is correct** for the question: *What is the stoppage time for the first half?*\n\n### Evidence and Reasoning:\n\n1. **Scoreboard Display (Frames 1–5 and 6–30):**\n   - In **Frame 1**, the scoreboard clearly shows **45:42** and the score **0-0**.\n   - The match clock progresses through **45:43, 45:44, 45:45... up to 46:11** in Frame 30.\n   - This indicates that the first half officially ended at **45:00**, and **1 minute and 11 seconds of stoppage time** were played — meaning **at least 1 minute of stoppage time was added**.\n\n2. **Visible Clock Showing 45+ Minutes (Frames 6–30):**\n   - From **Frame 6 onward**, the scoreboard consistently displays times **beyond 45:00**, starting at **45:47** and going up to **46:11**.\n   - This confirms that **stoppage time was in effect** and that **the first half extended beyond 45 minutes**.\n\n3. **Match Officials Indicating Additional Time (Implied):**\n   - While the **referee holding up a board** is not visible in these frames, the **clock running past 45:00** is direct evidence that **stoppage time was signaled and being played**.\n   - In professional soccer, the fourth official displays the stoppage time on a board, and the referee enforces it. The fact that the clock runs to **46:11** implies that **at least 1 minute was signaled** — and likely more, but the question asks for the **stoppage time**, which is typically announced as a whole number (e.g., 1, 2, or 3 minutes).\n\n4. **First Half Ending Sequence:**\n   - The clock reaches **46:11** in the final frame, and the match is still ongoing — suggesting that **the referee has not yet blown the whistle for halftime**.\n   - However, the **presence of stoppage time is confirmed** by the clock going past 45:00.\n\n5. **Conclusion:**\n   - The **minimum stoppage time added** must be **at least 1 minute**, as the clock passes 45:00 and reaches 46:00+.\n   - In soccer, stoppage time is announced as a whole number (e.g., “1 minute added”), and the game continues until the referee blows the whistle — which may extend slightly beyond the announced time (e.g., 46:11).\n   - Therefore, the **stoppage time for the first half is 1 minute** — matching the answer **'1'**.\n\n✅ **Answer: '1' is correct.**"}, {'batch_start': 180, 'batch_end': 210, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2935.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2936.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2937.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2938.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2939.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2940.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2941.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2942.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2943.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2944.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw